 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "After the release, we write down what changed. When I use the library, I ask Maria for advice. I compare the dependency with my notes. Priya and I look for a detail in the changelog. After lunch, I check the breaking change again. When we meet, Leo says, \"I prefer the first option.\" I reply, \"I'd rather wait.\" The work is not easy, but I keep going.",
   "tts": "After the release, we write down what changed. When I use the library, I ask Maria for advice. I compare the dependency with my notes. Priya and I look for a detail in the changelog. After lunch, I check the breaking change again. When we meet, Leo says, \"I prefer the first option.\" I reply, \"I'd rather wait.\" The work is not easy, but I keep going.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "发布之后，我们记录有哪些变化。使用库时，我向 Maria 请教。我把依赖和我的笔记做了比较。Priya 和我在变更日志里找一个细节。午饭后，我又检查了一遍破坏性变更。见面时，Leo说：\"我更喜欢第一个方案。\"我回答：\"我宁愿等一等。\"工作不容易，但我继续前进。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "library",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "库，可被程序调用的一组现成功能"
    },
    {
     "w": "dependency",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "依赖，项目正常运行需要的外部软件"
    },
    {
     "w": "I prefer the first option.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我更喜欢第一个方案。"
    },
    {
     "w": "I'd rather wait.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我宁愿等一等。"
    },
    {
     "w": "changelog",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "变更日志，按版本记录项目变化的文件"
    },
    {
     "w": "breaking change",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "破坏性变更，会让旧用法不再兼容的变化"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "We compare two plans and choose one. At that moment, Priya says, \"This works better for me.\" Leo corrects my use of the pattern: The main reason is ... Priya and I look for a detail in the framework. After lunch, I check the package again. Before the meeting, I review the new feature one more time. The team talks about the bug fix entry at the standup. I write down what I learned today.",
   "tts": "We compare two plans and choose one. At that moment, Priya says, \"This works better for me.\" Leo corrects my use of the pattern: The main reason is  Priya and I look for a detail in the framework. After lunch, I check the package again. Before the meeting, I review the new feature one more time. The team talks about the bug fix entry at the standup. I write down what I learned today.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "我们比较了两个方案，选择了一个。这时，Priya说：\"这个对我更合适。\"Leo 纠正了我对这个句型的用法：主要原因是……Priya 和我在框架里找一个细节。午饭后，我又检查了一遍软件包。开会前，我又复习了一遍新功能。团队在站会上讨论了缺陷修复条目。我记下了今天学到的东西。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "framework",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "框架，为应用提供整体结构和规则的工具"
    },
