    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I review what I did today. When I use the deprecation notice, I ask Maria for advice. I compare the release summary with my notes. Priya and I look for a detail in the package manager. After lunch, I check the dependency version again. When we meet, Leo says, \"It depends on the situation.\" I reply, \"Let's choose this one.\" The changelog is clear. New users can understand it.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I review what I did today. When I use the deprecation notice, I ask Maria for advice. I compare the release summary with my notes. Priya and I look for a detail in the package manager. After lunch, I check the dependency version again. When we meet, Leo says, \"It depends on the situation.\" I reply, \"Let's choose this one.\" The changelog is clear. New users can understand it.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我回顾了今天做的事。使用弃用通知时，我向 Maria 请教。我把发布摘要和我的笔记做了比较。Priya 和我在包管理器里找一个细节。午饭后，我又检查了一遍依赖版本。见面时，Leo说：\"这取决于具体情况。\"我回答：\"我们选这个吧。\"变更日志很清楚。新用户能看懂。",
